  (MolecularDynamics.textbookHaarMassSmoothGenerator m β) (MolecularDynamics.textbookFourierRealMode c n) =
    -MolecularDynamics.textbookMassFourierFrequency m β n • MolecularDynamics.textbookFourierRealMode c n
