        G x * MolecularDynamics.textbookLangevinPeriodicDifferentialOperator U γ σ F x +
      σ ^ 2 *
        ∑ i,
          MolecularDynamics.textbookLangevinPeriodicDirectionalDerivative F (0, Pi.single i 1) x *
            MolecularDynamics.textbookLangevinPeriodicDirectionalDerivative G (0, Pi.single i 1) x
